    "text": "In the second excited state, <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />As <math><mi>E</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>and <math><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>",
